(* Ledger stage035 Mathematica audit: native source law and parity census.

   Standalone, print-only, assert-zero, exact, and file-I/O-free.

   Independent route: this engine builds an explicit normalized Gaussian
   mouth profile with time-dependent centers, forms D[sigma,t] + Div[...]
   directly, and uses Reduce for the unique coefficient.  Its parity census
   is generated by explicit reflection/time operators on formal monomials,
   while polar versus axial type is classified by Matrix/Det/Cross
   transformation tests.  This is materially distinct from the SymPy
   abstract-profile derivative identity and multiplicative Parity objects.

   Tooth-local runtime ablation uses LEDGER_STAGE035_MUTATION.
*)

